        "The 8051 has 128 bytes of on-chip RAM; the 8052 has 256.",
        "Stack operations use indirect addressing."
      ],
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/MCS-51_Programmer’s_Guide_and_Instruction_Set.PDF",
